  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-math-thinking-teacher",
      "text": "[中文](README.zh.md)\n\nA selectable high-school mathematics teacher Agent preset shell for DeepSeek Harness. Choose its dedicated mathematics preset from DSH's native new-session page, while ordinary DSH sessions keep their original capability set and prompt."
    },
    {
      "section": "Current scope",
      "text": "- Installation provides a selectable `AI 高中数学思维老师` Agent preset.\n- The preset registers an open, diagnosis-first tutoring guide and shows `Choose from questions` / `Upload your own problem` for a blank mathematics session.\n- A curated problem becomes the first learner message only after the learner selects it, and that message contains only the problem statement. The upload route writes neither a draft nor a message; the learner attaches or types a problem before sending.\n- After a substantive teaching intervention, the Agent records a student-facing learning note. The mathematics dock displays its latest observation, training goal, next step, and optional hint.\n- Ordinary sessions remain on `standard`; this plugin never changes a user's default preset."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-math-thinking-teacher\n```\n\nRestart DSH after installation. The plugin manages its own `math-thinking-teacher` preset in the DSH user-preset root; select it from DSH's native new-session preset control."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configure",
      "text": "Add a later row to your Web profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:\n\n```yaml\n- id: dsh-math-thinking-teacher\n  config:\n    presetId: math-thinking-teacher\n    teacherName: AI 高中数学思维老师\n\nThe generated preset files are plugin-owned. Override the teacher role, objective, diagnostic dimensions, intervention rules, and question bank through this configuration rather than editing them directly."
    },
    {
      "section": "Settings dialog",
      "text": "The `数学思维老师` page in DSH Settings persists the learner stage, teacher tone, and hint strength. These values override the matching profile defaults for the next mathematics-mode response; the question bank and core teaching rules remain profile-managed."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "After changing the plugin, run `pnpm build` and restart DSH Web to load the generated `lib/` files. Code changes should also run `pnpm test` and `git diff --check`."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
